'' std/fs (RFC-0009): an FsError built through the facade, passed to an FB.FsError parameter; an enum member; Exists; PathStem and PathExtension; std/path's folded BaseName and DirName.
'' It is a facade -- exported macros over the header, found through -i as a user's toolchain
'' finds it in its inc/ -- and the program includes that header too, so the facade's names
'' and the header's FB names are shown to be one and the same.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/fs.bas -o tests/modules/stdfs.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdfs.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1 false
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: c .txt b a
